@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Tender Timeline & Closing

DEVELOPER OWNER: Amal
MODULE: Sourcing Officer / Tender Management
TRELLO TASK: Tender Timeline & Closing
TRELLO URL: Not provided — add from the Trello board

PURPOSE:
Show the tender’s timeline and close the bidding window of
the current round.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Sourcing Officer

ROUTE: /SourcingOfficer/Tenders/Timeline/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Load the tender and its current TenderRound.
- POST Close: Status = Closed, ClosedAt; audit.
- Show the count of distinct suppliers with Submitted bids
  in this round only.

DEPENDENCIES:
Tenders, TenderRounds, TenderInvitations, Bids.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Tender Timeline & Closing";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "Tenders";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Dates of the current round and the action to close bidding.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Current round</h2>
    <dl class="pg-dl">
        <div><dt>Tender</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Round number</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Opens</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Deadline</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Closed</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Submitted offers (distinct suppliers)</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
    </dl>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Tender timeline</h2>
    <ol class="pg-steps">
        <li><div><strong>Draft</strong><small>Tender and items prepared</small></div></li>
        <li><div><strong>Round opened</strong><small>Suppliers invited</small></div></li>
        <li><div><strong>Deadline</strong><small>Bidding closes</small></div></li>
        <li><div><strong>Offers checked</strong><small>Minimum-offer rule applied</small></div></li>
        <li><div><strong>Next step</strong><small>Sent to evaluation, or a new round is started</small></div></li>
    </ol>
</section>

<partial name="_ConfirmAction" model='new ConfirmActionModel("Close bidding round", "Close the current round so no new offers can be submitted.", "Sets TenderRound.Status to Closed and ClosedAt (UTC).", false, false)' />
